## GLOBAL LAYOUT RULES

- **Max-width:** 600px, `margin: 0 auto`, `background-color: #F2F2F2` outer wrapper
- **Inner content column:** 600px, `background-color: #FFFFFF`
- **Column structure:** Single column throughout (brand rule). The only two-cell row is the QMG responder stat (brand rule). The floating sidebar CTA (forced axis) is resolved as an inset two-cell breakout row using `display:table` / `display:table-cell` — left cell 340px (teaser copy), right cell 220px (CTA button panel), both within the 600px column.
- **No CSS Grid, no Flexbox, no external fonts, no linked stylesheets.** All CSS inline.
- **Font stack throughout:** `Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif`
- **Images:** All images use `[images_base64_N]` placeholder tokens with required `alt=""` attributes.

