## COLOR PALETTE (ALL HEX CODES FIXED)

| Role | Hex | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| Near-black (primary structure) | `#0F1923` | Header band background, footer band background, section-entry declaration strips |
| Electric teal (accent) | `#00C2B5` | Bottom border on header, CTA button, data callout left-border accents, teal rule between sections |
| Brand violet (headlines, numerals) | `#4B2D8F` | All H1/H2 section headlines, primary efficacy numeral (36–42px), secondary numeral (22px) |
| Light violet tint (panel fills) | `#F5F1FC` | Data callout cell backgrounds, PD left-border panel background |
| Soft violet-grey (borders) | `#D8C9F0` | Callout cell borders, section dividers |
| White (content background) | `#FFFFFF` | Main content field |
| Near-white grey (alternating) | `#F9F9F9` | Greeting section background, signature section background |
| Body text | `#222222` | All body copy on white/near-white backgrounds |
| White on dark | `#FFFFFF` | Body copy on `#0F1923` backgrounds |
| REMS amber background | `#FFF8E1` | Meningococcal REMS panel only |
| REMS amber border | `#FFD54F` | Meningococcal REMS panel border only |
| REMS amber text | `#7B5A00` | REMS panel body text only |
| ISI/reference text | `#333333` | ISI block, reference footnotes |

**Near-black `#0F1923` is NEVER used as body text color on white.** It is a structural/background color only. Brand violet `#4B2D8F` is NEVER used as body text on white — headlines, numerals, and accent elements only.

